  "title": "Delivery Receipt Checklist",
  "subtitle": "Distribution Delivery Receipt: documents findings, limits, and disposition.",
  "description": "Delivery Receipt Checklist covers purchase-order shipment, handling unit, seal, receiving dock, and custody transfer. The receiving lead records Distribution Delivery Receipt criteria, findings, restrictions, and follow-up. Delivery Receipt Checklist keeps Distribution Delivery Receipt exceptions visible until the receiving lead handoff.",
  "use_case": "Use Delivery Receipt Checklist at origin, destination dock, staging zone, and receiving location. Document purchase-order shipment, handling unit, seal, receiving dock, and custody transfer identity before Distribution Delivery Receipt begins. Compare purchase-order shipment, handling unit, seal, receiving dock, and custody transfer findings with stated Distribution Delivery Receipt criteria; route unresolved Distribution Delivery Receipt issues to distribution operations reviewer.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
